data: {"item_id":"rs_516375","output_index":0,"sequence_number":116,"summary_index":0,"text":"The implementation seems to meet requirements. However earlier feedback about alert element lacking role attribute. The spec says \"displays a visible alert containing `Project name is required`\". Not necessarily ARIA role. The Playwright test may use getByText. The error previously from tool call not from test. Our current alert div has id=alert class=alert style display:none but no role attribute. Might be fine. But previous attempt added role attribute. Not required. However earlier error was tool call formatting.\n\nNow need to ensure commit is made. Check git status.","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

